@startuml Sequence_Diagram_Tambah_Item_Inventaris
!theme plain
title Sequence Diagram - Tambah Item Inventaris (REQ-APITS-F-03C)

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "Halaman Inventaris" as Inventaris
participant "Form Tambah Item" as Form
participant "Validation System" as Validation
database "Database" as DB
participant "Notification System" as Notif

Admin -> Inventaris: Akses halaman inventaris
activate Inventaris
Inventaris --> Admin: Tampilkan halaman dengan tombol "Tambah Item"
deactivate Inventaris

Admin -> Inventaris: Klik tombol "Tambah Item"
activate Inventaris
Inventaris -> Form: Buka form tambah item
activate Form
Form --> Admin: Tampilkan form input lengkap
deactivate Inventaris

Admin -> Form: Isi data item (nama, kategori, kode, stok, dll)
Form -> Validation: Validasi input data real-time
activate Validation

alt Data Valid
    Admin -> Form: Submit form dengan tombol "Simpan"
    Form -> Validation: Validasi final data
    Validation --> Form: Data tervalidasi
    deactivate Validation
    Form -> DB: Simpan data inventaris baru
    activate DB
    DB --> Form: Konfirmasi data tersimpan
    deactivate DB
    Form -> Notif: Trigger notifikasi sukses
    activate Notif
    Notif --> Admin: Tampilkan pesan berhasil
    deactivate Notif
    Form --> Admin: Redirect ke halaman inventaris
    deactivate Form
else Data Tidak Valid
    Validation --> Form: Return error messages
    deactivate Validation
    Form --> Admin: Tampilkan pesan error spesifik
    Admin -> Form: Perbaiki data yang tidak valid
    Form -> Validation: Validasi input data kembali
    activate Validation
end

@enduml